    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delia and their Glowing Pig Bao are in Glutinous Kingdom. After receiving a request to cure a sick child, they are wrapped in an adventure that spans the whole magical land! Shoot magical potions at the Rough Duck Gang, travel into Hel and make friends with ghosts and demons, and take a potion to fly through the night sky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delia: The Traveling Witch is a Narrative Action Platformer with lots of talking NPC's and locations to jump around in. It was made as a Gameboy game over the course of a few months.</p>",
